" font-size=\"22\">NERVOUS</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Brain, cord, nerves</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Rapid control</text><rect x=\"400\" y=\"360\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ENDOCRINE</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Glands, hormones</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Slow chemical control</text><rect x=\"730\" y=\"360\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CARDIOVASCULAR</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Heart, vessels, blood</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Transport</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"560\" width=\"340\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LYMPHATIC</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Nodes, spleen, thymus</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"675\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Immune defense</text><rect x=\"400\" y=\"560\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">RESPIRATORY</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Lungs, airways</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"675\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Gas exchange</text><rect x=\"730\" y=\"560\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">DIGESTIVE</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">GI tract + organs</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"675\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Nutrient absorption</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"760\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">URINARY</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Kidneys, bladder</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Filtration, waste</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"760\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"740\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">REPRODUCTIVE</text><text x=\"740\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Gonads, tracts</text><text x=\"740\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Gametes, offspring</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"960\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1005\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">11 systems — one integrated organism</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The eleven organ systems of the human body"
